  "10 August 2016, late afternoon. Staff report that the company's public website, imreallynotbatman.com, is showing an image that isn't theirs. You are the SOC analysts on shift.",
  "The site runs on the web server we1149srv (192.168.250.70). You have about an hour of that afternoon's logs: network captures (sourcetype stream:*), the intrusion detection system (suricata), the firewall (fgt_utm), the web server's own access log (iis) and endpoint telemetry from the server (Sysmon).",
  "Work out who attacked, how they got in, what they ran and how the defacement happened. Each step has an Open in SIEM button that starts you in the right place. Then decide what to do about it. All times are UTC."
 ],
